#: ../../../policy/CMP0229.rst:2
msgid "CMP0229"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0229.rst:6
msgid ""
"The :variable:`CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH` variable takes effect at target "
"creation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0229.rst:8
msgid ""
"CMake 4.5 and below apply the :variable:`CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH` "
"variable's value at the end of each directory to every target in that "
"directory.  CMake 4.6 and above instead prefer to initialize "
"the :prop_tgt:`SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH` target property from the variable as each "
"target is created.  This policy provides compatibility for projects "
"expecting the prior behavior."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0229.rst:14
msgid ""
"The ``OLD`` behavior for this policy ignores the value of "
"the :variable:`CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH` variable on target creation and use "
"its value at the end of each directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0229.rst:18
msgid ""
"The ``NEW`` behavior for this policy uses the value of "
"the :variable:`CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH` variable at target creation to "
"initialize the :prop_tgt:`SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH` property.  After that the "
"target property is used instead of the variable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/include/STANDARD_ADVICE.rst:1
msgid ""
"This policy was introduced in CMake version |INTRODUCED_IN_CMAKE_VERSION|. "
"It may be set by :command:`cmake_policy` "
"or :command:`cmake_minimum_required`. If it is not set, CMake |"
"WARNS_OR_DOES_NOT_WARN|, and uses ``OLD`` behavior."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/include/DEPRECATED.rst:2
msgid ""
"The ``OLD`` behavior of a policy is :ref:`deprecated by definition <cmake-"
"policies-intro>` and may be removed in a future version of CMake."
msgstr ""
